OpenLoader is a mod loader for Space Station 14, a popular multiplayer
space station simulation game. It is the successor to MarZeyLoader and
provides enhanced features for modding and game launching.

Features:
- Multi-account support
- Smart HWId spoofing
- Harmony patch support
- Cross-platform compatibility

This port builds OpenLoader natively for FreeBSD using the freebsd-x64
runtime identifier.

WWW: https://github.com/NLP-Core-Team/OpenLoader
